<LanguageData>
  

  <!-- EN: wanderer join -->
  <!-- EN: kiiro wanderer join -->
  <KiiroWandererJoins_Label>綺羅流浪者加入</KiiroWandererJoins_Label>
  <!-- EN: A ragged {PAWN_title} is approaching the colony. After {PAWN_pronoun} lost {PAWN_pronoun}'s home in the disaster, {PAWN_pronoun} has been wandering alone for several seasons and has now arrived here. {PAWN_pronoun} hesitantly requests to join and promises to make a meaningful contribution.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} claims to have nowhere else to go and is willing to contribute. {PAWN_subjective} will not leave voluntarily, and you can choose to refuse {PAWN_objective} and send {PAWN_objective} away. However, your colonists may feel uneasy about sending away someone in need. -->
  <KiiroWandererJoins_Desc>一名衣衫襤褸的{PAWN_title}正在靠近殖民地，家園在浩劫中毀於一旦后，[PAWN_pronoun]隻身一人經過數象的流浪來到了這裡。[PAWN_pronoun]試探著提出想要加入的請求，並且表示會不遺餘力地做出貢獻。\n\n[PAWN_pronoun]聲稱沒有地方可去， 並且願意做出貢獻。 {PAWN_objective}不會主動離開， 你可以選擇拒絕{PAWN_objective}，把{PAWN_objective}送走。然而，你的殖民者會對送走一個有需要的人感到不安。</KiiroWandererJoins_Desc>
  
  <!-- EN: reunion -->
  <KiiroRelativeJoins_Label>相聚</KiiroRelativeJoins_Label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} couldn't hide longing for {RELATIVE_labelShort} and returned to the place where they first met, wanting to live together with {RELATIVE_labelShort}. -->
  <KiiroRelativeJoins_Desc>{PAWN_nameDef}難掩對{RELATIVE_labelShort}的思念，回到了兩人最初見面的地方，想要與{RELATIVE_labelShort}共同生活下去。</KiiroRelativeJoins_Desc>
  
  <!-- EN: kiiro refugee baby -->
  <LetterLabelRefugeeKiiroBaby>綺羅託孤</LetterLabelRefugeeKiiroBaby>
  <!-- EN: The rustling sound came from the bushes, and a cat emerged carrying a kiiro baby. It gently set her down and then disappeared from view.\n\nThe origin of this baby is unknown, but her fate is now in your hands. -->
  <RefugeeKiiroBaby>草叢傳來窸窸窣窣的聲響，一隻貓叼著一個綺羅嬰兒從中鉆了出來。它輕輕地放下她，隨後轉身消失在了視野中。\n\n這名嬰兒的來歷無人知曉，但她的命運現在掌握在你的手中。</RefugeeKiiroBaby>
  <!-- EN: The rustling sound came from the bushes, and a cat emerged carrying a kiiro baby. It gently set her down on the ground and lingered nearby, reluctant to leave.\n\nThe origin of this baby is unknown, but her fate is now in your hands. -->
  <RefugeeKiiroBabyHasCat>草叢傳來窸窸窣窣的聲響，一隻貓叼著一個綺羅嬰兒從中鉆了出來。它輕輕地把她放在地上，在附近徘徊著遲遲不肯離去。\n\n這名嬰兒的來歷無人知曉，但她的命運現在掌握在你的手中。</RefugeeKiiroBabyHasCat>
  <!-- EN: A severely injured kiiro stumbled near your colony, tightly holding her child in her arms. However, her body, ravaged by pain and illness, could no longer sustain itself.\nHer arms, gradually losing warmth, stiffly maintained their embrace, holding her child close to her lifeless heart.\n\nNo one knows this mother's origin. Perhaps she got separated from original fleeing group, or maybe she was being pursued by some unknown force. Everything remains a mystery. But in her final moments, she chose to entrust her child to her only hope: the fate of this baby is now in your hands. -->
  <RefugeeKiiroBabyHasDeadParent>一名身受重傷的綺羅踉踉蹌蹌地來到了你的殖民地附近，懷裡緊緊地抱著她的孩子，但已如風中殘燭的她再也無法在傷痛和重病的侵蝕下支撐起自己的身體。\n她逐漸失去溫度的雙臂僵硬地維持著環抱的姿勢，將自己的孩子與她不再跳動的心緊緊地貼在一起。\n\n沒有人知道這位母親的來歷。也許是和逃難的隊伍走散，又或許是正被某些勢力追殺著，一切都不得而知；但她在生命的最後一刻選擇了將她的孩子託付給她唯一的希望：這名嬰兒的命運現在掌握在你的手中。</RefugeeKiiroBabyHasDeadParent>
  <!-- EN: A severely injured kiiro stumbled near your colony, tightly holding her child in her arms. However, her body, ravaged by pain and illness, could no longer sustain itself.\n\nNo one knows this mother's origin. Perhaps she got separated from original fleeing group, or maybe she was being pursued by some unknown force. Everything remains a mystery; but the fates of she and her baby is now in your hands. -->
  <RefugeeKiiroBabyHasParent>一名身受重傷的綺羅踉踉蹌蹌地來到了你的殖民地附近，懷裡緊緊地抱著她的孩子，但已如風中殘燭的她再也無法在傷痛和重病的侵蝕下支撐起自己的身體。\n\n沒有人知道這位母親的來歷。也許是和逃難的隊伍走散，又或許是正被某些勢力追殺著，一切都不得而知；但她和她的孩子的命運現在掌握在你的手中。</RefugeeKiiroBabyHasParent>
  

